msgid ""
"This form lets you automatically import videos from popular platforms like "
"<strong>YouTube</strong> and <strong>Vimeo</strong>.<br><br>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tTo import from these platforms, you need to set up an "
"<strong>API Key</strong>.<br>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tYou can configure this under the <a href=\"%s\" "
"target=\"_blank\">API Keys</a> settings page.<br><br>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tLet's walk through the key steps to set up your first import."
