"strong>, <strong>Playlist</strong>, <strong>Search Results</strong>, or a "
"custom list of video URLs."
msgstr ""

#: premium/admin/automations.php:926
msgid "Configure Source Input"
msgstr ""

#: premium/admin/automations.php:927
msgid ""
"Based on the selected <strong>Source Type</strong>, you will see relevant "
"input fields appear below.<br><br>For example, if you select "
"<strong>Channel</strong>, you'll be asked to enter the channel ID. Make sure "
"all required fields are correctly filled for smooth imports."
msgstr ""

#: premium/admin/automations.php:934
msgid ""
